---
title: "Suggestions"
description: "Collect ideas, votes and decisions in one visible flow."
featureKey: "community.suggestions"
permalink: "/modules/community/suggestions/"
---
{% set feature = helperDocs.byKey[featureKey] %}
<p class="eyebrow">{{ feature.category | upper }} - {{ feature.taskGroup | upper }}</p>
<h1>{{ feature.title }}</h1>
<p class="lede">{{ feature.summary }}</p>
<div class="status-row"><span class="status status-{{ feature.maturity }}">{{ feature.statusLabel }}</span><span>Source commit: <code>{{ helperDocs.sourceCommit }}</code></span></div>
{% if feature.maturity == 'blocked' %}<div class="notice notice-warning"><strong>Not currently available.</strong> This page describes the planned experience and its dependencies. There is no activation or publishing action today; details may change before release.</div>{% endif %}
<div class="module-grid"><section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">START HERE</p><h2>What this does</h2><p>{{ feature.summary }}</p><h3>When to use it</h3><p>Use this module when you want a clear, server-scoped way to {{ feature.title | lower }}. Start with the recommended setup, then open advanced options only when you know what you need.</p></section><aside class="card"><p class="eyebrow">BEFORE YOU START</p><h2>Requirements</h2><ul class="check-list">{% for permission in feature.permissions %}<li>{{ permission }}</li>{% else %}<li>Permissions will be shown here when the adapter requires them.</li>{% endfor %}{% for intent in feature.intents %}<li>Discord intent: {{ intent }}</li>{% endfor %}{% for dependency in feature.dependencies %}<li>Dependency: {{ dependency }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul></aside></div>
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">CONFIGURE</p><h2>Recommended setup</h2>{% if feature.maturity == 'blocked' %}<p>The planned flow will begin with a guided setup and a preview. It will not publish anything until the required provider, review, or contract is available.</p>{% else %}<ol class="steps"><li>Open the Helper panel for the selected server.</li><li>Review the permissions and preflight result.</li><li>Choose the recommended defaults, simulate the change, and publish only after the preview is correct.</li></ol>{% endif %}<details><summary>Advanced technical reference</summary><dl class="technical-list"><dt>Adapter</dt><dd><code>{{ feature.adapter }}</code></dd><dt>Capabilities</dt><dd>{% for item, enabled in feature.capabilities %}{{ item }}{% if enabled %} enabled{% else %} unavailable{% endif %}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% endfor %}</dd><dt>Schema version</dt><dd>{{ feature.schemaVersion }}</dd></dl></details></section>
{% if feature.commands and feature.commands.length %}<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">REFERENCE</p><h2>Commands</h2><ul>{% for command in feature.commands %}<li><code>{{ command }}</code></li>{% endfor %}</ul></section>{% else %}<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">REFERENCE</p><h2>Commands</h2><p>This module is configured from the panel; no public command is listed in the technical manifest.</p></section>{% endif %}
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">SIMULATION AND RECOVERY</p><h2>Preview, health and rollback</h2><p>{% if feature.capabilities.simulation %}Use the panel simulation to see the matched rules and expected effects before publishing.{% else %}A simulation is not currently exposed for this module.{% endif %} {% if feature.capabilities.health %}The panel also reports health and dependency problems.{% endif %} {% if feature.capabilities.rollback %}Published revisions can be reverted without deleting history.{% endif %}</p>{% if feature.configurable %}<a class="button" href="https://vozen.org/panel{{ feature.panelPath }}">Open in Helper panel</a>{% endif %}</section>
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">TROUBLESHOOTING</p><h2>Common problems</h2><ul><li>If the panel reports a missing permission, check both the bot role and channel-specific overwrites.</li><li>If a resource was deleted, refresh the server context before publishing again.</li><li>If a provider is unavailable, pause the subscription and follow the provider status page.</li></ul><p><a href="/docs/helper/troubleshooting/missing-permissions/">Missing permissions</a> - <a href="/docs/helper/troubleshooting/role-hierarchy/">Role hierarchy</a> - <a href="/docs/helper/troubleshooting/restore-configuration/">Restore configuration</a></p></section>
<section class="card"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h2>Data and related features</h2><p>Vozen stores only the configuration and event data required by the module. Content retention, if offered, is opt-in and bounded by the server policy.</p><p>Related: <a href="/docs/helper/security/privacy/">Privacy and stored data</a> - <a href="/docs/helper/status/features/">Feature status</a></p></section>

